  "release_date": "2025-03-29T00:00:00Z",
  "updated": "2025-03-29T00:00:00Z",
  "description": "Copernicus-FM is a unified Earth observation foundation model capable of processing any spectral or non-spectral sensor modality from all major Copernicus Sentinel missions, using dynamic hypernetworks and flexible metadata encoding. It is pretrained on the Copernicus-Pretrain dataset (18.7M images) and evaluated on the Copernicus-Bench benchmark (15 hierarchical downstream tasks).",
  "sci:doi": "10.48550/arXiv.2503.11849",
  "license": null,
